BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:andros-kato-katakoilos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kato-katakoilo-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Kato Katakoilos and Panachrantou
LOCATION:Kato Katakoilos\, Andros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:In Kato Katakoilos\, the terraced village behind Batsi\, the feast of Agios Panteleimon on 26-27 July follows the Andros pattern: church\, then greetings from house to house with food and drink offered at each\, and dancing. The monastery of Panachrantou above Falika also celebrates the saint with a liturgy the same day.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/andros/#kato-katakoilos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kato-katakoilo
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/andros/#kato-katakoilos-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kato-katakoilo
END:VEVENT
