BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:andros-arni-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-arni-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiros)\, Arni
LOCATION:Arni\, Andros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Arni\, the highest and greenest village on Andros\, celebrates the Transfiguration with a panigiri on the evening of 5-6 August: froutalia (the Andros potato-and-sausage omelette)\, roast meat\, wine and violins in the square\, organised by the village association with free entry. The road up from Batsi is long and twisty\; allow 40 minutes.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/andros/#arni-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-arni
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/andros/#arni-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiros-arni
END:VEVENT
