DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panagia of Panachrantou
LOCATION:Andros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Pilgrimage to the cliff-top monastery above Korthi. The icon is revered for healing properties\; villages across the island send delegations.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/andros/#panagia-of-panachrantou
